WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.302 --> 00:00:12.637
We finally made it.

00:00:13.096 --> 00:00:15.807
How many muggers are there
in this town, anyway?

00:00:16.224 --> 00:00:18.351
Okay, time to find the acupuncturist.

00:00:18.476 --> 00:00:21.646
I'm gonna get me a beer first.

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:22.564
Hey.

00:00:23.398 --> 00:00:24.357
Get me a beer.

00:00:32.073 --> 00:00:34.659
How's your Magic going?

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:36.536
Yeah, not bad.

00:00:36.661 --> 00:00:38.580
Hey, Sorcerer.

00:00:41.416 --> 00:00:42.250
Huh?

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:44.836
Who's there?

00:00:51.843 --> 00:00:54.387
You're not it.

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:55.889
Hey.

00:00:57.182 --> 00:01:00.351
What did the guy in my mouth say?

00:01:00.435 --> 00:01:03.021
That I wasn't it.

00:01:03.104 --> 00:01:04.147
Yeah?

00:01:05.023 --> 00:01:06.691
-Then die.
-Caiman.

00:01:07.275 --> 00:01:09.194
You found him? How was it?

00:01:09.277 --> 00:01:12.530
It wasn't him. I'm just about to kill him.

00:01:12.947 --> 00:01:16.367
Hold on a sec, why do you want to kill me?

00:01:16.451 --> 00:01:18.369
You came to see me, right?

00:01:18.453 --> 00:01:20.789
I'll fix your poor face up with my Magic.

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:24.793
I don't need your pity!
Magic doesn't work on me.

00:01:25.376 --> 00:01:27.170
I specialize in transforming faces.

00:01:27.879 --> 00:01:29.714
Come on, give it a try.

